that I have been subtly refining for 11 years - it includes a sequence of
checkpoints from first proposal, to submission of materials, to pilot testing,
to administration methods, statistical analysis and reporting.  My outline
for writeups helps decompose a complex process into a series of manageable
steps.  If this framework was so smooth that it was barely visible, then I
have succeeded BUT unfortunately the perception that I hear from you is that
